--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications in this directory
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

backbone/ holds SolarWM source files with only their import paths changed;
backbone/decode.py is the decode_write function of full_inference.py, extended to
write TAEHV output.
router/attention.py adapts sgf_attention.py to sparse video queries.

backbone/taehv.py is TAEHV (https://github.com/madebyollin/taehv), copied
unchanged from commit 011dfc2112197741c540e0bdd5b7b67bcc930771; the taeh3
decoder weights (weights.taeh3) come from the same commit. Its licence:

